        "slc_fbe64318ad5a41f5629d052838bddc0c557024236a3c8ac28caad45ca418e244"
      ],
      "text": "Every model call is reserved before it happens and settled after, against a ledger with non-negative constraints in the database schema, so a set budget ceiling is enforced rather than estimated."
    },
