        "slc_4265b6a48bb38730f064b7031a582298ad570d9526de2b6abf1fc6eeed4fa3e8"
      ],
      "text": "Claims whose quotes do not appear verbatim in the mined page are discarded at extraction; surviving claims can be re-read against sources and marked unsupported in the report."
    },
