      "text": "The pipeline runs planner, executor, actor (search/fetch/extract/mine), verifier (pairing, adjudication, claim graph, re-read sampling), and output stages, with three actor types: web, academic (Crossref, OpenAlex, arXiv, PubMed), and local_compute."
