  "summary": "Selected evidence records: Mole is a deep-research agent that decomposes a question, searches, extracts claims, quote-checks each against its source, detects contradictions, and writes a cited answer. Every model call is reserved before it happens and settled after, against a ledger with non-negative constraints in the database schema, so a set budget ceiling is enforced rather than estimated.",
